<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12371] Explicit method for starting client nodes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12371</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Right now there is almost 500 explicit usage of &lt;tt&gt;setClientMode&lt;/tt&gt; in tests.&lt;br/&gt;
Seems we should support the starting of client nodes in test framework.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should introduce method &lt;tt&gt;startClientNode(String name)&lt;/tt&gt; and similar.&lt;br/&gt;
This will simplify tests.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
